0.2), transparent); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\" />\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt;\\\">近日地球頻傳生態危機，像是亞馬遜雨林今年至少發生<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">7</span>萬次火災，歐洲地區屢創下高溫記錄，不免讓人擔憂地球真的「生病了」，蜜蜂雖然很多人看到會害怕，卻是世界上對自然生態系統最重要的物種，但過去<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">3</span>個月內，巴西約有<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">5</span>億隻蜜蜂死亡。</span></p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt;\\\">蜜蜂除了採花蜜產蜂蜜外，地球上許多農作物、植物都需要昆蟲授粉才能繁殖生長，而蜜蜂就是這些植物可以順利繁殖的重要貢獻者，也是自然界中不可或缺的傳粉者，不只在生物多樣性上有關鍵作用，對人類來說，蜜蜂也是維持糧食穩定生產的偉大功臣，蜜蜂的地位自然不可言喻。</span></p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt;\\\">根據外媒報導，聯合國糧農組織<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">(FAO)</span>數據顯示，世界上<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">75%</span>的農作物都由蜜蜂負責傳粉，但近年來全世界的蜜蜂數量卻持續下降，<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2018</span>年<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">12</span>月至<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2019</span>年<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2</span>月巴西至少有<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">5</span>億隻蜜蜂死亡，光南里約格蘭德<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">(Rio Grande do Sul)</span>，就有<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">4</span>億隻蜜蜂死亡的驚人數據，巴西政府今年批准使用<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">300</span>種新農藥，而專家表示最大罪魁禍首就是殺蟲劑。</span></p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt;\\\">開放使用的農藥中，很多含有芬普尼<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">(fipronil)</span>，通常會加在殺蟲劑裡面，用來驅除蟑螂、跳蚤等害蟲，有研究指出芬普尼不僅危害動物還有環境，也有可能致癌，此類農藥歐盟已經禁用，巴西養蜂協會副主席<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Aldo Machado</span>表示殺蟲劑大量害死蜜蜂，或因蜜蜂死亡造成糧食問題，人類未來安全也令人擔憂，「所有被毒死的蜜蜂，都預示著人類未來被毒死的風險」。</span></p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt;\\\">文章來源：<a href=\\\"https://www.bbc.com/news/newsbeat-49406369\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(138, 185, 51); text-decoration: none; transition: all 0.3s ease 0s; outline: 0px; cursor: pointer;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">BBC</span></a></span></p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">資料來源：</span><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">https://www.chinatimes.com/hottopic/20190827003961-260803?chdtv</span></p>\n","keyword":"","news_order_id":"0","create_date":"2019-09-02","clk_count":"194"}},"__N_SSG":true}